---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Adrian Lee — Community Ecosystem Strategist, Certified AI Governance Professional. A decade of building and governing communities at Google, Wargaming, Binance, OKX and more."
>

  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="page-header__eyebrow">
          <div class="section-label"><span class="label">About</span></div>
        </div>
        <h1 class="page-header__title">
          The person behind<br>
          <em>the playbook.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="page-header__desc">
          Community strategist, platform safety practitioner, and AI governance thinker. 
          I've spent a decade inside some of the world's most complex digital communities — 
          learning what makes them thrive, and what makes them break.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BIO SECTION -->
    <section class="bio section" aria-labelledby="bio-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="bio__grid">

          <div class="bio__photo-col">
            <div class="bio__photo-wrap">
              <img
                src="/images/adrian-lee.jpg"
                alt="Adrian Lee"
                width="440"
                height="560"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="bio__social">
              <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/adrianlee" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" id="about-linkedin">
                LinkedIn ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bio__text-col">
            <h2 id="bio-heading">My story</h2>
            <div class="prose">
              <p>
                I didn't start as a community builder. I started as someone who got deeply 
                frustrated by how online communities were governed — or rather, how they weren't.
              </p>
              <p>
                My early career in gaming operations at <strong>IAHGames</strong> taught me that 
                communities don't spontaneously self-organize into healthy ecosystems. They require 
                intentional architecture: the right rituals, incentives, moderation philosophies, 
                and feedback loops. Get these wrong, and you get toxicity, churn, and collapse. 
                Get them right, and you get something genuinely rare — a community people choose 
                to stay in.
              </p>
              <p>
                That observation became an obsession. Over the next decade, I took that question 
                into increasingly complex environments: large-scale gaming ecosystems at 
                <strong>Wargaming</strong>, trust and safety programs at <strong>Google</strong>, 
                and then into the wild frontier of crypto communities at <strong>Binance</strong> 
                and <strong>OKX</strong> — where the governance stakes were genuinely high.
              </p>
              <p>
                Along the way, I noticed a pattern: the organizations building AI were making 
                the same structural mistakes as the platforms building communities. Governance 
                was an afterthought. Participation was performative. And when things went wrong, 
                there was no human infrastructure to absorb the damage.
              </p>
              <p>
                That's what led me to AI governance — not as a pivot, but as a natural extension. 
                Community architecture and AI governance are solving the same problem: how do 
                you build human systems that remain trustworthy at scale?
              </p>
              <p>
                Today, I work at that intersection — helping organizations think clearly about 
                community design, platform safety, and the governance of AI systems. I'm a 
                <strong>Certified AI Governance Professional (CAIGP)</strong> and bring 
                practitioner-level depth to both sides.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VALUES -->
    <section class="values section--sm" aria-labelledby="values-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="label">What I believe</span></div>
        <h2 id="values-heading">Principles that guide the work</h2>

        <div class="values__grid">
          <div class="value__card card">
            <div class="value__number">01</div>
            <h3>Human systems first</h3>
            <p>
              Technology is only as good as the human systems surrounding it. Every tool, 
              platform, and AI system is embedded in social context. Design for that context 
              or fail because of it.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value__card card">
            <div class="value__number">02</div>
            <h3>Governance isn't bureaucracy</h3>
            <p>
              Good governance is what allows speed without chaos. It's the difference between 
              a community that scales and one that fragments. It enables autonomy rather than 
              restricting it.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value__card card">
            <div class="value__number">03</div>
            <h3>Participation is the mechanism</h3>
            <p>
              Whether you're building a community or governing an AI system, the best 
              outcomes come from meaningful participation — not just consultations, 
              but genuine influence over decisions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value__card card">
            <div class="value__number">04</div>
            <h3>Honest over impressive</h3>
            <p>
              I'd rather share what didn't work than pretend everything is a success story. 
              The most useful knowledge in community building comes from failure — examined 
              carefully and shared openly.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EXPERIENCE TIMELINE -->
    <section class="experience section" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="label">Experience</span></div>
        <h2 id="experience-heading">Where I've been</h2>

        <div class="timeline">

          <div class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline__content">
              <div class="timeline__org-row">
                <span class="timeline__org">OKX</span>
                <span class="timeline__period">2022 — Present</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline__role">Community &amp; Ecosystem Lead</h3>
              <p>Global community strategy for one of the world's largest crypto exchanges. Platform safety, moderation at scale, community governance frameworks.</p>
              <div class="timeline__tags">
                <span class="badge badge--community">Community</span>
                <span class="badge badge--ai">Platform Safety</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline__content">
              <div class="timeline__org-row">
                <span class="timeline__org">Binance</span>
                <span class="timeline__period">2021 — 2022</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline__role">Community Operations Lead</h3>
              <p>Built and scaled community operations across Southeast Asia. Moderation policy, community health metrics, crisis communication frameworks.</p>
              <div class="timeline__tags">
                <span class="badge badge--community">Community</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline__content">
              <div class="timeline__org-row">
                <span class="timeline__org">Google</span>
                <span class="timeline__period">2019 — 2021</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline__role">Trust &amp; Safety / Community Programs</h3>
              <p>Trust and safety programs, content moderation policy, community health initiatives across Google's consumer products.</p>
              <div class="timeline__tags">
                <span class="badge badge--ai">Platform Safety</span>
                <span class="badge badge--ai">AI Governance</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline__content">
              <div class="timeline__org-row">
                <span class="timeline__org">Wargaming</span>
                <span class="timeline__period">2016 — 2019</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline__role">Game Operations &amp; Community Manager</h3>
              <p>Community management and operations for World of Tanks and flagship titles across Asia Pacific. Scaled community programs to millions of players.</p>
              <div class="timeline__tags">
                <span class="badge badge--community">Community</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline__content">
              <div class="timeline__org-row">
                <span class="timeline__org">IAHGames</span>
                <span class="timeline__period">2013 — 2016</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline__role">Community &amp; Game Operations</h3>
              <p>Early career in gaming community management. Developed foundational skills in community engagement, player communications, and event operations.</p>
              <div class="timeline__tags">
                <span class="badge badge--community">Community</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__dot timeline__dot--special"></div>
            <div class="timeline__content">
              <div class="timeline__org-row">
                <span class="timeline__org">SPF</span>
                <span class="timeline__period">Earlier</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline__role">Singapore Police Force</h3>
              <p>National service and foundational experience in systems thinking, crisis management, and institutional governance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CREDENTIALS -->
    <section class="credentials section--sm" aria-labelledby="credentials-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="label">Certifications &amp; credentials</span></div>
        <h2 id="credentials-heading">Qualifications</h2>
        <div class="credentials__grid">
          <div class="credential__card card card--featured">
            <div class="credential__icon">🏛️</div>
            <h3>Certified AI Governance Professional</h3>
            <p>CAIGP · IAPP / AIGP certification. Covers AI risk management, regulatory frameworks, responsible AI deployment, and governance program design.</p>
            <span class="badge badge--ai" style="margin-top: 0.75rem; display: inline-flex;">AI Governance</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="about-cta section--sm" aria-labelledby="about-cta-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-cta__inner card card--featured">
          <h2 id="about-cta-heading">Ready to work together?</h2>
          <p>Whether you need community strategy, AI governance advisory, or a speaker for your event — let's talk.</p>
          <div class="about-cta__buttons">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="about-contact-cta">Get in touch →</a>
            <a href="/services" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" id="about-services-cta">View services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.about-page { padding-top: var(--nav-h); }

/* BIO */
.bio__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr; gap: var(--space-16); align-items: start; }
.bio__photo-wrap { border-radius: var(--radius-xl); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border-soft); margin-bottom: var(--space-5); }
.bio__photo-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 520px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; }
.bio__social { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); }
.bio__text-col h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .bio__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .bio__photo-wrap img { height: 380px; }
}

/* VALUES */
.values section { background: var(--bg-surface); }
.values h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-10); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); }
.values__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--space-5); }
.value__card { padding: var(--space-8); }
.value__number { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--terracotta); letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
.value__card h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
.value__card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .values__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* TIMELINE */
.experience h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-10); }
.timeline { position: relative; padding-left: var(--space-10); }
.timeline::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 7px; top: 8px; bottom: 0;
  width: 1px;
  background: var(--border-soft);
}
.timeline__item { position: relative; margin-bottom: var(--space-10); }
.timeline__item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.timeline__dot {
  position: absolute;
  left: calc(var(--space-10) * -1 + 1px);
  top: 8px;
  width: 13px; height: 13px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--bg-elevated);
  border: 2px solid var(--border-soft);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  z-index: 1;
  transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);
}
.timeline__item:hover .timeline__dot { border-color: var(--terracotta); }
.timeline__dot--special { border-color: var(--ochre); background: var(--ochre-glow); }
.timeline__org-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
.timeline__org { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--terracotta); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.timeline__period { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-faint); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
.timeline__role { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
.timeline__content p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
.timeline__tags { display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); flex-wrap: wrap; }

/* CREDENTIALS */
.credentials h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
.credentials__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-5); }
.credential__card { padding: var(--space-8); }
.credential__icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
.credential__card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
.credential__card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; }

/* CTA */
.about-cta__inner { padding: var(--space-12); text-align: center; }
.about-cta__inner h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
.about-cta__inner p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); max-width: 480px; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
.about-cta__buttons { display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
